cleaning\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"构造一个故意错误的清洗结果，把 DEMO-02 的“不直接证明”删成“证明”。\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"将结果与原段落逐字核对，发现判断被反转。\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"恢复关键限制，保留 DEMO-02 编号，再检查相关问答是否重复进入训练与测试。\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"得到忠于材料且带出处的片段。错误版本只用于演示清洗风险，不进入正式知识依据。\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"去重和防泄漏有关，但仅做一次精确去重仍不保证没有近似重复。\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"训练题与测试题措辞不同但答案和场景相同，能仅凭文本不同认定独立吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:cleaning-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:cleaning-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:cleaning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-cleaning\",\"content\":\"不能。还需检查内容、来源和近似关系。应把可能重合的样例单独核查，避免只换说法就认为没有泄漏。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"评测集\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"数据与评测\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"固定独立问题与判分要点，分别检查内容、引用和无答案处理。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"评测集是一组事先确定的问题、支持材料和判分规则，用来比较不同方案。独立指题目和答案没有被拿来训练或反复调方案，不只是换一个文件名。评测前先约定什么算答对，才能减少看完答案后临时改标准的倾向。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"损失是训练优化信号，评测集是检查任务表现的一组独立问题。两者可以相互参照，不能互相替代。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"独立检验\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"写出一条测试题及评分要点，区分训练记录和任务收益。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"课程答疑不能只检查说法是否流畅。还要检查关键条件有没有遗漏、引用是否真的支持结论，以及资料没有答案时是否恰当说明不知道。先固定问题和设置，再保存逐题回答与判分理由。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"写下要点：不能由训练损失直接推出答疑可靠；需要独立任务检验。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"把“是否保留这个限制”和“引用是否支持结论”分开判断。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"另加无答案题“本课程期末考占多少分”，三段教学材料均没有该信息。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"合格示例答复应说明还需独立评测，并引用 DEMO-02；对考核比例应说明资料不足。这里展示评分规则，不报告任何模型得分。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"只有文件名不同、题目却高度重复，仍可能造成数据泄漏。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"训练前后都换了测试题，还能把分数差直接归因于微调吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"不能。题目难度与评分规则也变了。应固定独立问题、提示和判分规则，保留配置后再比较；这仍不自动排除其他混杂因素。\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-14\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-14\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"一条评测记录应包含什么\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-15\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-15\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"字段\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-16\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-16\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"应记录的内容\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-17\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-17\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"问题与依据\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-18\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-18\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"题目、支持片段及版本\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-19\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-19\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"判分\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-20\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-20\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"内容、引用、拒答分别记录及理由\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-21\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-21\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"运行条件\"}],[\"map:domain:evaluation-set-22\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set-22\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:evaluation-set\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-evaluation-set\",\"content\":\"模型、提示、检索设置与时间\"}],[\"map:domain:model\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"模型\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\"}],[\"map:domain:model-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\",\"content\":\"先理解文字怎样进入模型，再看信息怎样聚合。分清 Token、注意力与 Transformer 的不同作用。 这些概念说明模型怎样计算，不直接证明回答可靠。把结构与训练、推理、引用核对连接起来，才能避免仅凭模型名称判断效果。\"}],[\"map:domain:model-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\",\"content\":\"先理解文字怎样进入模型，再看信息怎样聚合。分清 Token、注意力与 Transformer 的不同作用。\"}],[\"map:domain:model-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\",\"content\":\"这些概念说明模型怎样计算，不直接证明回答可靠。把结构与训练、推理、引用核对连接起来，才能避免仅凭模型名称判断效果。\"}],[\"map:domain:model-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\",\"content\":\"文字怎样被处理？\"}],[\"map:domain:model-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\",\"content\":\"能串起文字单位、信息聚合和结构组织，解释它们的不同作用。\"}],[\"map:domain:model-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:model-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:model\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-model\",\"content\":\"Token、注意力、Transformer 处在不同观察层次，不能当作同类替代方案。\"}],[\"map:domain:token\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Token\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"模型\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\"}],[\"map:domain:token-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"文字经分词器变成处理单位；实际切分取决于具体分词器。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"模型不能直接按人的阅读习惯处理整段文字。分词器先把文本切成 token，并映射为编号，模型再把这些编号转成可计算的表示。可以先把 token 看作所选系统处理文字的基本单位，不急着背诵实现细节。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"字符、单词、token 不是固定的一一对应关系。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"输入单位\"}],[\"map:domain:token-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"解释分词器的作用，避免把字符数直接当成 token 数。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"不同分词器可能对同一句话给出不同切分。一个汉字、英文单词、标点都不固定对应一个 token。输入长度和上下文限制通常与这些单位有关，实际长度需要用对应模型的分词器检查，而不是凭肉眼估计。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:token-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"拿示例问题作为输入，先标出文字、标点和词组。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"人为画出若干可能的切分，仅说明“同一句话可以有不同单位边界”。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"不报告伪造的 token 数；真实操作需选定分词器并记录版本后观察。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"理解了“文本 → token 编号 → 可计算表示”的入口。这些示意边界不是任何真实模型的实际分词结果。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"token 编号只是入口，不能直接把编号大小解释为词义相似程度。\"}],[\"map:domain:token-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"十个汉字一定占十个 token 吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:token-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:token-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:token\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-token\",\"content\":\"不一定。切分由具体分词器决定，需用匹配的分词器检查。不能把这个教学示意当成真实切分记录。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"注意力\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"模型\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"先按相关程度得到权重，再聚合信息；权重不等于事实可信度。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"注意力按当前计算的相关程度聚合上下文信息。查询 Q 可理解为当前需要寻找什么，键 K 参与比较匹配程度，值 V 是被聚合的信息。先理解“比较得到权重，再加权组合”，再去学习矩阵表达。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"注意力是一种机制，Transformer 是组织多种模块的结构。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"计算机制\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"用小例子解释相关性权重与加权聚合，并知道它不代表完整解释。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"这些计算是模型内部机制，不是人工给资料标注可信度。某处权重大，并不自动说明它就是回答的完整原因，也不能证明结论真实。课程答疑中的证据是否支持结论，仍需要独立核对资料。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"为理解课程问题的上下文聚合，先用数值 2、4 和人为权重 0.75、0.25 做一个小算例。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"人为设两个一维值为 2 和 4，权重设为 0.75 和 0.25。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"计算加权聚合：0.75×2＋0.25×4＝2.5。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"说明权重只是人为指定以便检查算式，不来自模型，也不是对教学片段的可信度评分。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"得到 2.5，演示了加权聚合。真实注意力还涉及表示、匹配和归一化，不能用这个算例替代模型整体计算。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"注意力权重不是引用核验分数，也不应被当作完整因果解释。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"把同一个值的权重提高，能直接说明事实更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"不能。加权计算改变信息的聚合方式，事实可靠性还需要核对支持材料与任务表现。这是两类不同的检查。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-14\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-14\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"进阶：缩放点积注意力\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-15\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-15\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"先比较 Q 与 K，再归一化得到权重，最后聚合 V。符号表达用于连接原始材料，不代表所有后续模型的完整实现。\"}],[\"map:domain:attention-16\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:attention-16\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:attention\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-attention\",\"content\":\"Attention(Q,K,V) = softmax(QKᵀ / √dₖ)V\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Transformer\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"模型\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"把注意力与其他模块组织为逐层处理序列的结构。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"Transformer 把注意力、前馈网络等模块组织起来处理序列。注意力说明上下文信息怎样聚合；结构说明这些模块怎样组合、逐层计算。可以把它先理解为计算的组织方式，而不是某个已经完成训练的具体产品。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"Transformer 与注意力不是同义词。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"模型结构\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"区分模型结构、内部机制和训练过程。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"同一种结构可以配合不同数据与训练任务形成不同模型。已有模型如何处理输入，还要看具体配置和实现。原始论文提供重要起点，但不能被直接套用为每个后续模型的完整描述，更不能由结构名称推出课程答疑的质量。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"把课程问题转换为输入表示，作为模型计算的入口。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"画出“表示 → 注意力等模块 → 后续计算 → 输出”的简化顺序。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"分别标明：这里描述结构；参数如何形成要到预训练与适配部分继续理解。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"得到一张机制与结构的简化示意，帮助区分“怎样组织计算”和“怎样学习参数”；不是任何具体模型的完整架构图。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"模型结构、训练阶段和实际系统服务属于不同观察层次。\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"知道一个模型采用 Transformer，就能推出它一定会正确引用课程材料吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:transformer-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:transformer-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:transformer\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-transformer\",\"content\":\"不能。还需要资料、训练与提示、检索和评测等条件。结构名称不足以证明某项任务表现。\"}],[\"map:domain:training\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"训练与适配\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\"}],[\"map:domain:training-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\",\"content\":\"已有基座怎样形成，又怎样适配？把训练阶段、优化信号、任务和更新方案分开理解。 课程助手可以先使用已有模型。只有明确了稳定问题、样本、评测与资源条件，才讨论是否适配；这里的教学示例不表示本组已训练或获得收益。\"}],[\"map:domain:training-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\",\"content\":\"已有基座怎样形成，又怎样适配？把训练阶段、优化信号、任务和更新方案分开理解。\"}],[\"map:domain:training-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\",\"content\":\"课程助手可以先使用已有模型。只有明确了稳定问题、样本、评测与资源条件，才讨论是否适配；这里的教学示例不表示本组已训练或获得收益。\"}],[\"map:domain:training-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\",\"content\":\"能力怎样形成和调整？\"}],[\"map:domain:training-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\",\"content\":\"能解释 SFT 与 LoRA 如何配合，并用独立评测检验是否值得适配。\"}],[\"map:domain:training-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:training-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:training\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-training\",\"content\":\"训练阶段、优化目标、适配任务与更新方案并列便于学习，不是同级技术分类。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"预训练\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"训练与适配\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"理解可复用基座怎样形成，区分使用已有模型与从头训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"预训练是在较大范围数据和训练任务上形成可复用能力的过程。基座是后续使用或适配的已有模型，不是从空白开始的每次聊天。理解这一层，可以区分模型能力形成与课程助手应用构建的不同工作规模。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"使用预训练模型不等于执行了预训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"训练阶段\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"说明已有基座的来处，以及使用基座不等于本组做过预训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"课程助手可以先使用已有基座，将精力放在资料、检索、提示和独立评测。是否继续做监督微调，需要看稳定的行为问题与资源条件。参数量和预训练数据量都不能直接替代课程任务中的质量检查。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"列出本例已有条件：三段教学材料与一个候选已有模型。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"明确没有本组从头训练基座的记录，因此不把应用演示写成预训练成果。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"先设计独立问题与基线，再判断已有能力是否足够以及是否值得适配。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"将“选择已有基座”“运行回答”“必要时做适配”区分开。这里给出学习与比较流程，不推荐具体型号或声称完成训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"模型大或训练数据多，也仍需在课程问题上检验回答与引用。\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"调用已有模型回答了课程问题，能写成本组完成了预训练吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:pretraining-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:pretraining-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:pretraining\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-pretraining\",\"content\":\"不能。那是对已有模型的使用或推理。应准确记录选择、配置和实际做过的工作，不把应用调用写成基座训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"损失\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"训练与适配\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"读懂训练优化信号，并与独立问题上的任务表现分开判断。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"损失是训练时用来衡量当前输出与目标差距的数值。训练过程利用由此得到的信号更新参数，使当前目标更好地被满足。读一条损失曲线，至少要同时知道训练数据、目标定义和比较设置，不能只看曲线向下。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"训练损失与独立评测分别观察优化信号和任务表现。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"优化目标\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"解释训练损失反映什么，以及为什么需要另看独立任务表现。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"课程答疑更可靠还涉及未见问题的正确性、引用与资料不足时的处理。训练信号和任务结果有关联，但不是同一件事。数据重复、目标不合适或对训练样例过度适应，都可能使好看的训练记录不能变成真实收益。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"不编造一条实际 loss 曲线，先假设某次训练记录显示数值下降。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"用同一组独立题核对是否保留“还需评测”的限制以及引用是否正确。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"将训练记录与逐题任务判断分栏保存，避免用一个数字替代全部结论。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"合适的判断是“训练目标上的数值改善，实际答疑收益仍待独立检验”，而不是填写一个并未测得的准确率。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"不同数据与设置下的 loss 数值，不宜脱离条件直接比较。\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"loss 下降，但无答案题开始乱编，能称为答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:loss-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:loss-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:loss\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-loss\",\"content\":\"不能直接这样称呼。至少无答案处理变差了，应分项记录并查明原因。训练信号改善不能抹掉任务中的失败。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"监督微调 SFT\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"训练与适配\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"用核对过的示范学习任务行为；与 LoRA 分别讨论训练任务和更新方案。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"监督微调 SFT 用“输入与示范回答”继续训练已有模型，让它学习特定任务中的输出行为。基座指适配前已有的模型，参数指模型中可被训练更新的数值。先有明确、稳定的行为问题，再准备经过核对的示范样本。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"微调改变模型参数，RAG 在回答时提供外部资料。资料缺失和输出习惯不合适，需要分别排查。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"适配任务\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"说明 SFT 学习什么，以及它与 LoRA 分别回答什么问题。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"SFT 描述训练任务；LoRA 描述更新哪些参数的一种方案。可以使用 LoRA 做 SFT，也可以更新全部参数。示范中的格式、引用和拒答方式都可能被学习，但训练过这些样例并不保证所有新问题都正确。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"把问题和 DEMO-02 作为输入材料。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"写出示范回答：“不能直接说明。还需独立问题检验内容、引用和无答案处理［DEMO-02］。”\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"核对示范是否忠于资料，再把不同问题留作独立评测，而非把所有题都送去训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"得到一条待核查的训练样本设计，而不是已经训练好的模型；是否有收益必须另做对照评测。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"LoRA 不是 SFT 的反义词；一种是更新方案，一种是训练任务。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"“用了 LoRA，所以没有进行 SFT”这个判断成立吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"不成立。可以在 SFT 任务中使用 LoRA 更新适配器参数。还需检查实际训练数据、目标和配置，不能只凭工具名称判断。\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-14\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-14\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"SFT 与 LoRA 的区别\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-15\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-15\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"对象\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-16\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-16\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"回答的问题\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-17\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-17\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"本例需要检查\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-18\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-18\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"SFT\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-19\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-19\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"用什么示范学习什么行为\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-20\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-20\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"示范回答及数据切分\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-21\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-21\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"LoRA\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-22\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-22\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"哪些参数参与更新\"}],[\"map:domain:finetuning-23\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:finetuning-23\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:finetuning\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-finetuning\",\"content\":\"适配器配置和实现条件\"}],[\"map:domain:lora\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"LoRA\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"训练与适配\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"冻结基座、训练低秩增量；参数减少不等于整套训练免费。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"LoRA 是一种参数高效适配方法。冻结基座表示在适配时保留原有权重不更新，另外训练一组低秩增量。权重可以看成参与模型计算的数值表；低秩用两个较窄的矩阵表达增量，不要求初学者先掌握完整矩阵推导。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"冻结不是删除基座；运行时仍需要基座和适配器配合。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"参数更新方案\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"解释冻结基座、训练增量，以及为什么少量参数不等于免费训练。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"它可以用在监督微调等训练任务中。减少可训练参数有助于改变适配的资源需求，但整套运行仍包含基座、激活、数据与优化过程。是否适合当前模型、任务和设备，需要核对实现条件，不能由“参数少”直接推出效果更好或总成本最低。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"沿用课程助手的 SFT 示范样本，将待适配权重示意为 4×4 的矩阵 W。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"把基座权重示意为一个 4×4 矩阵 W。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"另设 4×1 的 B 与 1×4 的 A，二者相乘得到同样为 4×4 的增量。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"在 SFT 示例中更新 A、B，保留 W；这个小矩阵只解释形状，不模拟真实模型资源。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"W 与增量共同参与适配后的计算。示例没有训练结果、准确率或显存结论，也不意味着所有实现只需保存这些数值。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"低秩是增量表达的约束，不能简单理解为“把整套模型缩小”。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"只拿到一个 LoRA 适配器，就能不依赖匹配的基座回答问题吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"通常不能。适配器表达对匹配基座的增量，需要核对基座版本、结构和加载方式。不要把适配器当作独立完整模型。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-14\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-14\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"进阶：增量表达与 QLoRA\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-15\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-15\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"r 是需要选择的秩，α 控制增量的缩放；这只是表达方式，不是本项目的推荐参数。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-16\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-16\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"QLoRA 在量化冻结基座上训练低秩适配器。量化、计算精度和训练状态会共同影响资源，不能把量化权重大小等同于训练峰值显存。\"}],[\"map:domain:lora-17\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:lora-17\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:lora\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-lora\",\"content\":\"W′ = W + (α / r) BA\"}],[\"map:domain:system\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"系统\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\"}],[\"map:domain:system-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\",\"content\":\"先找到证据，再组织回答并核对引用。分清检索、推理、部署与反馈，沿失败回查各环节。 任何一环成功都不能替代整体检查。先用手动教学示例走通输入输出，再在真实实验中保存配置、证据与失败，不把本静态地图写成已上线的模型服务。\"}],[\"map:domain:system-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\",\"content\":\"先找到证据，再组织回答并核对引用。分清检索、推理、部署与反馈，沿失败回查各环节。\"}],[\"map:domain:system-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\",\"content\":\"任何一环成功都不能替代整体检查。先用手动教学示例走通输入输出，再在真实实验中保存配置、证据与失败，不把本静态地图写成已上线的模型服务。\"}],[\"map:domain:system-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\",\"content\":\"怎样形成可用的答疑助手？\"}],[\"map:domain:system-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\",\"content\":\"能沿问题、证据、回答、核对与反馈走完一条完整检查链。\"}],[\"map:domain:system-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:system-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:system\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-system\",\"content\":\"检索组件、问答架构、运行过程、服务组织和反馈各有边界，彼此可以组合。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"检索与证据片段\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"系统\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"按问题寻找可回溯的支持片段，区分主题相关和足以支撑结论。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"检索按问题从资料中寻找相关片段。先把材料整理成可定位的片段，建立查找所需的索引，再返回候选内容和出处。小规模资料可以先用关键词方法跑通流程，不必一开始就搭建复杂系统。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"主题相关与足以支持结论是不同的标准。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-3\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-3\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"检索组件\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-4\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-4\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"把问题对应到支持片段，并区分相关资料和有效证据。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-5\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-5\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"向量检索把文本表示为可比较的向量；索引帮助查找，重排用于进一步排序。它们分别服务检索的不同环节，不是事实核验的替代。主题相近的片段可能仍不足以回答问题，因此要检查候选片段是否真的包含支持结论的条件。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-6\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-6\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"训练损失下降，就能说明课程答疑更可靠吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-7\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-7\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"查找“训练损失”和“可靠”，把 DEMO-02 作为支持片段。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-8\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-8\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"将只解释 token 的 DEMO-01 作为不支持当前结论的对照。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-9\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-9\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"保留片段编号与文字，交给 RAG 的回答过程，再核对是否正确使用。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-10\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-10\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"当前问题应保留 DEMO-02 的关键限制，不能因为某段材料也谈模型就把它当成有效证据。这里是手动选片段，不报告检索命中率。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-11\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-11\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"索引、向量与重排不是三个都必须启用的独立系统，是否采用要回到任务评测。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-12\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-12\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"检索返回了讲 token 的片段，就能证明损失下降会提升答疑质量吗？\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-13\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-13\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"不能。该片段没有支持这个判断。应返回损失与独立评测的材料，找不到时说明依据不足。\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-14\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-14\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"分块、索引与排序各做什么\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-15\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-15\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"环节\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-16\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-16\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"用途\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-17\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-17\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"需要检查\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-18\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-18\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"分块\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-19\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-19\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"形成可定位片段\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-20\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-20\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"上下文与出处是否完整\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-21\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-21\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"索引\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-22\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-22\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"支持查找\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-23\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-23\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"资料与索引版本是否匹配\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-24\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-24\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"重排\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-25\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-25\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"调整候选顺序\"}],[\"map:domain:retrieval-26\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:retrieval-26\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:retrieval\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-retrieval\",\"content\":\"是否确有任务收益\"}],[\"map:domain:rag\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:rag\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:rag\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"RAG\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"领域地图\",\"系统\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-rag\"}],[\"map:domain:rag-0\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:rag-0\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:rag\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-rag\",\"content\":\"先找到依据，再生成并核对回答；分别检查检索错和资料误用。\"}],[\"map:domain:rag-1\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:rag-1\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:rag\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-rag\",\"content\":\"RAG 是检索增强生成：先按问题从资料中寻找相关片段，再把这些片段交给模型组织回答。这里的“增强”是提供外部上下文，不意味着资料一旦给到模型，回答就自动正确。先保存问题与命中的片段，才能判断后续错误发生在哪里。\"}],[\"map:domain:rag-2\",{\"id\":\"map:domain:rag-2\",\"page_id\":\"map:domain:rag\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/docs/domain/#node-rag\",\"content\":\"检索找到资料不等于生成正确；引用存在不等于引用支持结论。\"}],[\"m